  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Tech</strong></p><p><strong>Discharged:</strong> Choose a point you can see within Very Close range to place your snare and roll a number of <strong>d20s</strong> equal to your Power trait. When a target moves within Very Close range of this snare, they must make a Reaction Roll with a Difficulty equal to your highest result. If they fail, they are stopped in their movement for this GM move. The snare stays in place until it's triggered or the scene ends. Place this card in your vault after placing the snare.</p><p><strong>Charged:</strong> <strong>Spend a Charge</strong> to place a snare with the same rules as <em>Discharged</em>. If the target fails their Reaction Roll, they are temporarily <em>Restrained</em>. If they succeed, they are stopped in their movement for this GM move.</p><p><strong>Overcharged:</strong> <strong>Spend 2 Charges</strong> to place a snare with the same rules as <em>Discharged</em>. If the target fails their Reaction Roll, they are temporarily <em>Restrained</em> and <em>Stunned</em>. If they succeed, they are temporarily <em>Restrained</em>. Place this card in your vault after placing the snare.</p>",
